{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "5_01_049_23",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:04cb958c96f5e5f94b20916acc4d12f6c5fcd5db167499c8b32617b3d3334703",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:5_01_049_23:5_01_049_23_a:cmd-000014:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a5bd4d18b3aad1bcafcc6f211b7a8942e9f3f09e5f0ab3da4f4cb16c489f28db",
      "text": "来，●●●●プロデューサー。\n在这里挑选你喜欢的东西吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_01_049_23:5_01_049_23_a:cmd-000016:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f4d4b64ff245a0e9101955b621a2693f85f52218009ae6992abca8ea7bd8e41c",
      "text": "好厉害，不管哪家店都陈列着各种各样的巧克力\n呢！……不过锐心先生，真的可以吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_01_049_23:5_01_049_23_a:cmd-000021:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7e2841aecae71320dc755a3959570cf10773eceedfb7a979452b5328b543ef87",
      "text": "嗯。让你亲自挑选效率更高。\n作为平日里的谢礼，也由我来送你巧克力吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_01_049_23:5_01_049_23_a:cmd-000024:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:84ffbc70ae22a35a556abd96bf999c0a6fc08d839c4a64d1fd458a6c4bc24cb9",
      "text": "非常感谢。那我就恭敬不如从命了。\n选哪个好呢……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_01_049_23:5_01_049_23_a:cmd-000030:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:85c34831c599cf2701a9493c95a9d1f2bb54b5ca3304b0e14407cbdd0288a67b",
      "text": "……转角处那家，是最近在演艺圈很受关注的店。\n父母也经常把别人送来慰劳的这家店的东西带回来。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_01_049_23:5_01_049_23_a:cmd-000035:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:59d062ee7ba3adf27538585320c43da797ee87a038eba9615b4f053cf2bfa7fa",
      "text": "如果想要蛋糕的话，那家店也不错。\n据说特色是特制的海绵蛋糕胚和上佳的口感。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_01_049_23:5_01_049_23_a:cmd-000039:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:bd631aef6f551140bcdca87251549ef13518117c0d60e6d25d2984d67bf6af19",
      "text": "如果想单纯品味巧克力的话，\n那边的店更好。我也曾经吃过。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_01_049_23:5_01_049_23_a:cmd-000041:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0322e47567dd805a335c717617973f65856ff0a32f76cf416ed585af4f190530",
      "text": "锐心先生，你了解得好清楚啊！\n感觉每一个都好好吃的样子，我都开始纠结了……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_01_049_23:5_01_049_23_a:cmd-000045:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:5d1f3df94d042d64b9b8f53d12f1d7166c00b2c1064827b056c8b03207ecf6da",
      "text": "既然这么犹豫，全部买下来不就好了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_01_049_23:5_01_049_23_a:cmd-000052:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c260008c34d8e9830b1653963269f55bc4b3bb7f535e2c9d8e01dd19279cf2e7",
      "text": "一想到这是对你工作的感谢与对价，\n根本算不上什么大不了的量。对吧？",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
